# ===== Separate concurrent session's work: not part of this commit =====
# A different, concurrent Claude Code session (see OVERNIGHT_B9_EXTERNAL_STATUS.md
# at repo root, written by that session) is running/has run a large B9/B3
# seed-landscape sweep (PHM2010 D1/D2/D3 + NASA N1-N4 + MTW-CM, 700+ runs,
# still growing as of this .gitignore edit) inside this Chinese-named
# diagnostic tree, under its own separate user instructions -- deliberately
# kept out of this English-named methods/ framework. That status doc itself
# asks for user confirmation before committing/pushing. Whole directory
# excluded wholesale (rather than per-subdirectory) since it is still
# actively being extended; the user should review and decide what (if
# anything) to commit from THAT work separately from this task's own work.
/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/
/OVERNIGHT_B9_EXTERNAL_STATUS.md
/MTW_TASK_AUDIT.md
/NASA_TASK_AUDIT.md

# ---- User has now explicitly reviewed and authorized committing the
# aggregated summary results, audit docs, and pipeline code from the
# 05_统计检验/seed_statistics/ tree above (707 PHM2010+NASA B9 runs + 707
# paired B3 runs, all complete). Per-seed raw artifacts (predictions,
# checkpoints, training logs, frozen-preprocess derived feature tables)
# stay excluded/local -- only small aggregated CSVs, audit/status
# markdown, and the .py/.sh pipeline code are un-ignored below.
!/OVERNIGHT_B9_EXTERNAL_STATUS.md
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/
# Re-exclude the large per-seed landscape trees (predictions/checkpoints/logs
# for all 707+707(+303 MTW) runs) even though the parent dir above is un-ignored --
# only the aggregated summary_*/ + _shared_code/ + top-level *.md below are meant
# to be committed.
/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/B9_*_seed_landscape/
/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/B3_*_seed_landscape/
/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/_mtw_run_root/
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/*.md
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/summary_PHM2010/
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/summary_PHM2010/**
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/summary_NASA/
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/summary_NASA/**
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/summary_MTW/
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/summary_MTW/**
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/_shared_code/
!/05_统计检验/seed_statistics/_shared_code/**
# The new B1/B2 seed-task scripts + their vendored_legacy/ dependency copy
# (this task's own work, git-clone-portable) also live under _shared_code/,
# already covered by the recursive un-ignore above -- listed here only for
# clarity: run_b1_seed_task.py, run_b1_nasa_seed_task.py, run_b1_mtw_seed_task.py,
# run_b2_seed_task.py, run_b2_nasa_seed_task.py, run_b2_mtw_seed_task.py,
# vendored_legacy/**.

# ===== Frozen-preprocess artifacts needed by B1/B2 (this task) on all 3 datasets =====
# PHM2010_D1 was already committed before this round. D2/D3 (PHM2010),
# NASA_N1-4, and MTW_D1-M/D2-M/D3-M were built by the other concurrent
# session but are needed by this task's own B1/B2 scripts to be git-clone
# portable -- committing them is this task's own scope, not a judgment call
# about the other session's separate seed-landscape RESULTS trees above.
!/shared/reproducibility/build_phm_task_frozen_preprocess.py
!/shared/reproducibility/PHM2010_D2_frozen_preprocess/
!/shared/reproducibility/PHM2010_D2_frozen_preprocess/**
!/shared/reproducibility/PHM2010_D3_frozen_preprocess/
!/shared/reproducibility/PHM2010_D3_frozen_preprocess/**
!/shared/reproducibility/NASA_N*_frozen_preprocess/
!/shared/reproducibility/NASA_N*_frozen_preprocess/**
!/shared/reproducibility/build_nasa_task_frozen_preprocess.py
!/shared/reproducibility/MTW_*_frozen_preprocess/
!/shared/reproducibility/MTW_*_frozen_preprocess/**
!/shared/reproducibility/build_mtw_task_frozen_preprocess.py

# ===== Python / OS cruft =====
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ===== Raw PHM2010 dataset (18GB+, fetched via scripts/download_phm2010.py) =====
# The small DERIVED feature file data/PHM2010/features/run_level_features_all.csv
# (5.4MB, irreproducible from a lost original extraction script per
# baselines/htt_net/README.md, no license issue) is deliberately NOT excluded here
# and IS committed -- see data/README.md.
/data/PHM2010/raw/

# ===== Training checkpoints / large binaries (regenerable by rerunning a method) =====
# Default --save-checkpoint is "none"; even when a user opts into saving them,
# they must never be committed.
**/*.pth
**/*.pt
**/*.pkl
**/*.ckpt

# ===== Smoke-test scratch output (never mixed into results/) =====
/tmp/

# ===== Formal per-seed run artifacts under results/ =====
# Only small aggregated summary/*.csv files are committed -- see RESULTS_POLICY.md
# "What gets committed to git". Per-seed predictions/logs/configs stay local.
/results/PHM2010/*/*/seed*/

# ===== Credentials =====
.env
*.kaggle.json
kaggle.json
.kaggle/

# ===== Per-method preprocessing caches (regenerable, machine-local) =====
# Several methods cache derived windows/images on first use (e.g.
# methods/B5_MultiSource_Attention/_cache/, methods/data/PHM2010/cache/) --
# never the raw dataset itself, always a regenerable intermediate.
**/_cache/
**/cache/
**/*.npy
**/*.npz

# ===== Re-un-ignore: frozen-preprocess .pkl/.npy artifacts =====
# gitignore is order-sensitive -- the **/*.pkl / **/*.npy blanket rules above
# (for regenerable checkpoints/caches) would otherwise re-hide the GMM model
# and scaler files inside the frozen-preprocess directories un-ignored
# earlier in this file (PHM2010_D1's equivalents were already committed
# before these blanket rules existed, so they were unaffected -- D2/D3/NASA/MTW
# need this explicit override). These are small (<2KB each), fitted,
# hash-manifested artifacts -- not caches, not checkpoints.
!/shared/reproducibility/PHM2010_D2_frozen_preprocess/*.pkl
!/shared/reproducibility/PHM2010_D2_frozen_preprocess/*.npy
!/shared/reproducibility/PHM2010_D3_frozen_preprocess/*.pkl
!/shared/reproducibility/PHM2010_D3_frozen_preprocess/*.npy
!/shared/reproducibility/NASA_N*_frozen_preprocess/*.pkl
!/shared/reproducibility/NASA_N*_frozen_preprocess/*.npy
!/shared/reproducibility/MTW_*_frozen_preprocess/*.pkl
!/shared/reproducibility/MTW_*_frozen_preprocess/*.npy
